    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I'm looking at using 6x6 posts for the main support. If I'm dealing with a heavy snow load like we get here in the winters, how much extra capacity do I need to bake into the beam size to make sure it doesn't sag or fail under the weight?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
